---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Cuenta Suspendida | Essenz"
  description="El acceso a tu panel de administración ha sido pausado temporalmente."
>
  <main
    class="relative min-h-[calc(100vh-80px)] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-24 overflow-hidden"
    style="background-color: var(--clr-bg);"
  >
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-0"
      style="opacity: 0.02;"
    >
      <span
        class="text-[35vw] font-bold leading-none select-none uppercase"
        style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--clr-ink);"
      >
        PAUSED
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div
        class="relative w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 mb-10 group transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute -top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex gap-3 opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-500"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-3 h-6 text-(--clr-accent) animate-pulse"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3c-1 2-4 3-4 6s3 4 2 7"></path></svg
          >
          <svg
            class="w-3 h-6 text-(--clr-ink) animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 200ms;"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3c-1 2-4 3-4 6s3 4 2 7"></path></svg
          >
        </div>

        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 120 120"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          class="w-full h-full drop-shadow-xl"
          style="color: var(--clr-ink-dark);"
        >
          <path
            d="M 85 45 C 112 45, 112 75, 85 75"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="10"
            stroke-linecap="round"></path>

          <path d="M 25 30 L 95 30 L 85 90 C 83 102, 37 102, 35 90 Z" fill="currentColor"></path>

          <path d="M 27 45 L 93 45" stroke="var(--clr-bg)" stroke-width="3"></path>

          <path
            d="M 48 72 L 48 60 C 48 50, 72 50, 72 60 L 72 72"
            fill="none"
            stroke="var(--clr-accent-light)"
            stroke-width="4"
            stroke-linecap="round"></path>
          <rect x="42" y="68" width="36" height="26" rx="4" fill="var(--clr-accent)"></rect>
          <circle cx="60" cy="78" r="3" fill="var(--clr-bg)"></circle>
          <path d="M 60 79 L 60 86" stroke="var(--clr-bg)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
          ></path>

          <circle cx="20" cy="85" r="2" fill="var(--clr-accent-light)" opacity="0.4"></circle>
          <circle cx="102" cy="35" r="3" fill="var(--clr-accent)" opacity="0.3"></circle>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight"
        style="color: var(--clr-ink-dark); font-family: var(--font-display);"
      >
        Servicio pausado
      </h1>

      <p
        class="text-base md:text-lg mb-4 max-w-lg leading-relaxed mx-auto"
        style="color: var(--clr-ink); font-family: var(--font-body);"
      >
        No pudimos procesar el pago de la suscripción mensual de tu menú digital. El acceso a la
        plataforma administrativa se encuentra suspendido de manera temporal.
      </p>

      <div
        class="p-4 mb-10 text-sm max-w-md mx-auto text-left border border-dashed rounded-(--radius-card)"
        style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-accent) 5%, transparent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-ink) 20%, transparent); font-family: var(--font-ui);"
      >
        <p style="color: var(--clr-ink-dark); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">
          ⚠️ Política de resguardo de datos:
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--clr-ink); opacity: 0.85; font-size: 0.85rem;">
          Mantenemos tus menús, configuraciones y QR intactos por un periodo de **14 días**. Luego
          de este plazo, el sistema iniciará una depuración automática eliminando imágenes y
          registros permanentemente para liberar espacio en nuestros servidores.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full font-['Inter']"
      >
        <a
          href="/dashboard/billing"
          class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 text-white text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 w-full sm:w-auto"
          style="background-color: var(--clr-accent); border-radius: var(--radius-btn);"
          onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='var(--clr-green)'"
          onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='var(--clr-accent)'"
        >
          <span>Regularizar pago</span>
          <svg
            class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="mailto:soporte@bytesyncs.com?subject=Suscripcion%20Essenz%20Pausada"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 w-full sm:w-auto border"
          style="color: var(--clr-ink); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-ink) 30%, transparent); background-color: transparent; border-radius: var(--radius-btn);"
          onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-ink) 5%, transparent)'"
          onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='transparent'"
        >
          Contactar soporte
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
